{"3843760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward", "steam_appid": 3843760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/76743a99a8e4ae761017e18730276530.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/76743a99a8e4ae761017e18730276530.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/76743a99a8e4ae761017e18730276530.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/3acdaf6202bef9d2ed63a672eb2e2365.avif?t=1787193541\" width=780 height=90 /></span>ASHES OF THE DAMNED: THE FORGOTTEN WARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken inside an abandoned psychiatric ward with no memory of how you arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exits refuse to open. The lights fail without warning. Somewhere in the darkness, something is moving through the asylum with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ward, follow the clues left behind by its patients, solve its puzzles, and uncover your connection to the place. There is no combat. When something finds you, your only option is to keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FORGOTTEN WARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search multiple floors of the abandoned asylum, including patient rooms, treatment areas, offices, communal wards, and forgotten medical spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your map and objectives to navigate the building while searching for patient files, collectibles, puzzle items, and pieces of the ward’s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain rooms trigger the protagonist’s thoughts, revealing his reactions to the suffering and events that took place there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIECE TOGETHER THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover patient files, photographs, personal belongings, and other objects left behind by the people who lived and worked inside the asylum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each discovery reveals another fragment of the ward’s history and brings you closer to understanding why this place feels familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects provide answers. Others leave you with questions that may have been better left buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/83a33bcaa7599fa58125af69d566398b.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/83a33bcaa7599fa58125af69d566398b.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/83a33bcaa7599fa58125af69d566398b.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE SPIRIT VISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering a strange pair of glasses, you gain access to Spirit Vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to reveal hidden puzzle pieces scattered throughout the asylum. Find every piece, reconstruct the damaged photograph, and uncover the combination needed to open a locked safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a35dce3c51dac3fbea2faec4a4f486f3.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a35dce3c51dac3fbea2faec4a4f486f3.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/a35dce3c51dac3fbea2faec4a4f486f3.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE WHAT WAITS INSIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, supernatural entities begin to appear throughout the ward. Some encounters are brief warnings. Others place you directly in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot fight back. Pay attention to your surroundings, keep moving, and never assume that a room is safe simply because you have already searched it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/f753265643d17e2f24e03b4035462dcf.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/f753265643d17e2f24e03b4035462dcf.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/f753265643d17e2f24e03b4035462dcf.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/7b7816b9227a0f3a9216734eb5362bf2.avif?t=1787193541\" width=780 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• First-person psychological horror with no combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A handcrafted, multi-floor psychiatric asylum to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Patient files, photographs, personal belongings, and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Spirit Vision that reveals hidden puzzle pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A photograph reconstruction puzzle leading to a safe combination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple supernatural encounters and scripted scare sequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Protagonist narration tied to certain rooms and discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A map and objective system that guides exploration without removing tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Minimal interface designed to preserve immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric lighting, environmental audio, and cinematic horror presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A complete standalone story set within a planned psychological horror anthology</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WARD REMEMBERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every patient file brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object carries part of a life that was forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step deeper into the asylum forces you to confront something you were never supposed to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You did not simply wake up inside the ward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You were always meant to return...</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/3acdaf6202bef9d2ed63a672eb2e2365.avif?t=1787193541\" width=780 height=90 /></span>ASHES OF THE DAMNED: THE FORGOTTEN WARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken inside an abandoned psychiatric ward with no memory of how you arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exits refuse to open. The lights fail without warning. Somewhere in the darkness, something is moving through the asylum with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ward, follow the clues left behind by its patients, solve its puzzles, and uncover your connection to the place. There is no combat. When something finds you, your only option is to keep moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/e3b3c51a8c62eba401cf04c1daa8e57b.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FORGOTTEN WARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search multiple floors of the abandoned asylum, including patient rooms, treatment areas, offices, communal wards, and forgotten medical spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your map and objectives to navigate the building while searching for patient files, collectibles, puzzle items, and pieces of the ward’s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain rooms trigger the protagonist’s thoughts, revealing his reactions to the suffering and events that took place there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.poster.avif?t=1787193541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.webm?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/8a8f0403940dc23f08d9fd69e601a38a.mp4?t=1787193541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PIECE TOGETHER THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><